        </a>
        <a href="/projects/deep-well-submersible-pump" class="block p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-blue-400 bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition-all">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 mb-1">PROJECT WORKFLOW</div>
